预留失败只再试一次，而且仍用这把键。熔断已经打开就不再发出：

```java
public LockResult reserve(String idemKey, ReserveRequest body) {
  if (!breaker.tryAcquirePermission()) {
    return LockResult.REJECTED;
  }
  long start = System.nanoTime();
  try {
    LockResult result = callOnce(idemKey, body);
    breaker.onSuccess(System.nanoTime() - start, java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.NANOSECONDS);
    return result;
  } catch (feign.RetryableException ex) {
    breaker.onError(System.nanoTime() - start, java.util.concurrent.TimeUnit.NANOSECONDS, ex);
    return callOnce(idemKey, body);
  }
}

private LockResult callOnce(String idemKey, ReserveRequest body) {
  return locks.reserve(idemKey, body);
}
```

拒绝连接、接受后不响应、池被占满，锁定库都不应出现新的预留行：

```sql
SELECT COUNT(*) FROM stock_lock WHERE idem_key = ?;
```
